WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:01.968
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)
-All right, here's our panel.

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:04.838
-He is a former foreign policy--
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:05.839
Oh, thank you.

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:10.009
Foreign policy advisor
to Senator Bernie Sanders,

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.711
who is now
the executive vice president

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:14.113
of the Center
for International Policy,

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.181
Matt Duss.

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:17.183
-Welcome to the show, Matt.
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.585
And he's a columnist
for<i> Tablet</i> magazine

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:20.820
and author of<i> Secret City,</i>

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.421
<i> The Hidden History
 of Gay Washington.</i>

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:24.723
James Kirchick
is back with us, Jamie.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:30.429
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)
-Um... So, um, difficult week,

00:00:30.629 --> 00:00:32.465
difficult to talk about it,
but we must.

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:35.501
Um, as often is the case,
this show is at variance

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:37.136
with some
of the conventional wisdom

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:38.771
and what we see
in the media a lot.

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:41.207
Um, mostly what I saw
this week was one,

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:43.076
a shocking amount of support,

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:46.212
like even at the moment...
(CHUCKLES) ...of the rampage,

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:48.614
or right after when they're
still counting the bodies.

00:00:48.847 --> 00:00:50.182
That was shocking to me.

00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:52.552
Uh, but even
at its best I feel--

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:55.722
feel like most of the people
who you would read in the media,

00:00:56.522 --> 00:00:58.057
the attitude is sort of like,

00:00:58.157 --> 00:00:59.959
"Well, you know,
this is very complicated.

00:01:00.025 --> 00:01:02.095
I didn't really study it,
I don't really know the facts,

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:03.596
so I'm just gonna go with

00:01:03.996 --> 00:01:05.965
a kind of
they're both guilty equally

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:07.266
and a moral equivalency,"

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:09.535
which I would like
to take issue with tonight.

00:01:09.835 --> 00:01:12.805
I think the Israelis have always
had the moral high ground

00:01:13.105 --> 00:01:14.239
and I think they still do.

00:01:14.306 --> 00:01:18.144
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)
-But, we'll get to that.

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:20.246
But, the...

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:24.784
I'd also like to say
to my friends in Israel,

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:27.353
there's a siege that's now been
going on for six days.

00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:31.991
No food, no water,
no medicine is getting in.

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:35.027
The head of the Red Cross
in the Mid East said today,

00:01:35.227 --> 00:01:36.396
"This is not acceptable.

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:38.698
We need a safe
humanitarian space."

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:40.867
I agree. (CLICKS TONGUE)

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:43.602
Uh, you know, don't lose
the moral high ground.

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:45.671
I mean,
I hate the word "proportionate"

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.339
when it comes to killing.
It's ho--

00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:50.176
It's horrible, but it's sort of
like the best we can do.

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:51.477
JAMES KIRCHICK: What does
that mean, "proportionate"?

00:01:51.577 --> 00:01:54.614
Well, I-- I just don't kn--
I don't know, but if Israel

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:57.716
is gonna kill babies now
for the next,

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.585
I don't know how long,
they're just gonna--

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:00.787
the world's just gonna
be able to say,

00:02:00.853 --> 00:02:02.188
"You just do it
in a different way."

00:02:02.321 --> 00:02:06.226
I'm just saying to Israel,
don't do what we did after 9/11.

00:02:07.326 --> 00:02:10.129
Don't do a Vietnam.
Don't do an Afghanistan.

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:12.065
Of course, you should retaliate.

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:13.499
Of course, you have every right.

00:02:13.932 --> 00:02:18.871
But this could go to a place
that is very bad for Israel.

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:20.907
I mean, I think your reference
to 9/11 is apt

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.676
because we're in a moment
right now of grief and trauma.

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:26.478
Um, Israelis, absolutely.

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:30.383
Um, and that's not a moment
to make great policy.

00:02:30.516 --> 00:02:31.951 line:0%
And I say that
with great respect.

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:33.920 line:0%
Um, they clearly
have to respond.

00:02:33.986 --> 00:02:35.221 line:0%
They have every right
to respond.

00:02:35.288 --> 00:02:36.488 line:0%
The Israeli government
has every right

00:02:36.588 --> 00:02:38.657 line:0%
and responsibility
to defend its people.

00:02:38.724 --> 00:02:40.426 line:0%
What we saw, uh, last weekend

00:02:40.493 --> 00:02:42.895 line:0%
was absolutely shocking
and barbaric.

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:45.598
Um, there are no two sides
to that.

00:02:46.065 --> 00:02:48.334
Um, we have to condemn
that unequivocally.

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:52.238
-There is no justification. I--
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:53.773
I will say that--

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:57.109
That doesn't--
That does not mean

00:02:57.176 --> 00:02:59.979
we can't have a conversation
about the deeper context here.

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:01.413
We have to have
that conversation.

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:04.249
That does not justify
in any way what happened.

00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:07.020
You said there's a siege
on Gaza. That's right.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:10.523
There has also been
a blockade, uh, since 2007.

00:03:10.756 --> 00:03:12.325
Um, that is part
of this context.

00:03:12.391 --> 00:03:15.961
Again, not a justification,
never a justification, um--

00:03:16.028 --> 00:03:19.098
Well, a blockade from a land
they gave back.

00:03:19.598 --> 00:03:20.800
-JAMES: Yeah.
-They gave back.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.235
-Gaza is not occupied.
-MATT DUSS: Well, they withdrew

00:03:22.302 --> 00:03:24.837
their forces and settlements
from within Gaza.

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:26.839
Okay, but the reason
there's a blockade

00:03:26.905 --> 00:03:29.074
is to stop shit like this
from happening.

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:30.709
-No, I agree with that.
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:03:30.776 --> 00:03:32.312
-That's the whole point.
-I think--

00:03:33.145 --> 00:03:34.146
And--

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:35.548
They gave it back.

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:38.151
They said, "You know what?
Make your life your own."

00:03:38.284 --> 00:03:40.887
This conflict right now
could end right this second

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:42.889
if Hamas were to put down
its weapons

00:03:43.189 --> 00:03:44.456
and surrender unconditionally.

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.559
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)
-I know, it would never happen.

00:03:46.625 --> 00:03:48.761
But that's--
But that's the reality.

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:51.163
And this has always been the--
it's always been the reality

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.265
-of this conflict.
-BILL MAHER: Yes.

00:03:52.332 --> 00:03:54.099 line:0%
If the Arabs were
to put down their weapons--

00:03:54.166 --> 00:03:55.535 line:0%
And this goes back to the 1930s,

00:03:55.635 --> 00:03:57.403 line:0%
before the creation
of the state of Israel.

00:03:57.537 --> 00:03:58.838 line:0%
If the Arabs put down
their weapons,

00:03:58.904 --> 00:03:59.906 line:0%
there would be peace.

00:03:59.972 --> 00:04:01.307 line:0%
If the Jews put down
their weapons,

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:02.808 line:0%
there'd be no more Jews
in the Middle East.

00:04:02.942 --> 00:04:04.376 line:0%
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)
-BILL: Yeah. Well, that's--

00:04:04.443 --> 00:04:05.945
And that's the thing I wanna--
I wanna get.

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:08.180
I mentioned this, about...

00:04:08.547 --> 00:04:09.481
Like, it bothers me,

00:04:09.748 --> 00:04:12.184
the moral equivalency that
goes on in the American media.

00:04:12.384 --> 00:04:15.854
I don't think Israelis would
ever purposely kill babies.

00:04:15.988 --> 00:04:17.323
I think they have killed babies.

00:04:17.389 --> 00:04:19.759
That's collateral damage,
which is another horrible thing,

00:04:19.825 --> 00:04:20.826
but that's part of war.

00:04:21.227 --> 00:04:22.728
-Well, purposefully or reckless?
-I think when--
I think that there's

00:04:22.828 --> 00:04:25.098
a very big difference
between rejoicing...

00:04:25.164 --> 00:04:26.899
-JAMES: Yes.
-...when you kill civilians,

00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:28.868
and the Israelis' regret

00:04:29.035 --> 00:04:31.070
-when they kill civilians.
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:04:31.137 --> 00:04:32.939
MATT: I'm not gonna take issue
with that, but let me add--

00:04:33.039 --> 00:04:35.341
let me add one thing
about the context here.

00:04:36.241 --> 00:04:37.743
Um, it is very important
to understand

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:40.446
that the Israeli strategy
up until last weekend

00:04:40.713 --> 00:04:43.549
had been to bolster
Hamas' control of Gaza.

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:46.085
There was a report that came out
of Benjamin Netanyahu

00:04:46.218 --> 00:04:48.420
talking to a meeting
of the Likud party in 2019...

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:49.655
-BILL: Yes.
-...saying, and I quote,

00:04:49.721 --> 00:04:51.891
"Our strategy-- Anyone who wants
to prevent the creation...

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:53.192
-BILL: I saw that.
-...of a Palestinian state

00:04:53.258 --> 00:04:55.427
has to bolster Hamas
and give them money.

00:04:55.528 --> 00:04:57.797
This is how we keep
the Palestinians divided,

00:04:57.864 --> 00:04:59.798
and therefore, there will never
be a Palestinian state."

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:01.867
This is not someone
who is interested in peace

00:05:02.001 --> 00:05:03.469
with the Palestinians.
I'm sorry.

00:05:03.669 --> 00:05:05.604
And this policy goes back
to the 1970s.

00:05:05.671 --> 00:05:09.441
Well, that's coming after
75 years of being attacked.

00:05:09.508 --> 00:05:10.776
Again, the question here is--

00:05:10.876 --> 00:05:11.944
So, it's not coming
in a vacuum...

00:05:12.011 --> 00:05:13.512
-I-- I totally agree.
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:15.581
-I would say there is--
-BILL: Let's-- Let's...

00:05:16.482 --> 00:05:19.018
Again, part of the challenge
of talking about this issue--

00:05:19.118 --> 00:05:21.086
And again, I just want to say
I appreciate being here

00:05:21.153 --> 00:05:22.488
to talk about this and I--

00:05:22.555 --> 00:05:25.658
You know, to have a really
respectful discussion here

00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:26.858
'cause I'll just say it again,

00:05:27.226 --> 00:05:29.261
what happened last weekend
is beyond shocking.

00:05:29.862 --> 00:05:32.131
But I think we can disagree
about the history.

00:05:32.331 --> 00:05:34.100 line:0%
We can disagree
about who did what

00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:36.101 line:0%
and who's to blame
at different times.

00:05:36.435 --> 00:05:37.470 line:0%
But ultimately,

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.905 line:0%
these two people are gonna
have to share this land,

00:05:40.373 --> 00:05:42.708 line:0%
and the question is,
how we get to that point?

00:05:42.842 --> 00:05:43.809 line:0%
BILL: Right.

00:05:43.909 --> 00:05:45.244
And we will talk
about the history,

00:05:45.311 --> 00:05:47.446
I just wanna finish
with the values first

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.348
because it's just amazing to me

00:05:49.582 --> 00:05:51.484
that the American Left,
so much of it,

00:05:51.617 --> 00:05:54.420
throws their lot in with people
whose values...

00:05:54.787 --> 00:05:56.789
(SCOFFS) ...I hope
they don't share,

00:05:56.922 --> 00:05:58.291
but let's go through them

00:05:58.591 --> 00:06:01.227
'cause values and customs
make a difference, okay?

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:03.363
And the people of Gaza--

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:06.365
By the way, if the Israelis
did get rid of Hamas,

00:06:06.499 --> 00:06:08.000
they'd be doing a giant favor

00:06:08.067 --> 00:06:10.036
to the people of Gaza
who hate Hamas too.

00:06:10.102 --> 00:06:11.103
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:06:11.169 --> 00:06:14.107
But, uh, let's just go
through the lists.

00:06:15.708 --> 00:06:17.310
Because the Israelis rep--

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:20.613
look like us
in most ways, values-wise.

00:06:20.846 --> 00:06:22.982
Maybe we're not doing it
the right way. I don't know.

00:06:23.115 --> 00:06:26.352
"Religious tolerance."
That doesn't exist in Gaza.

00:06:26.485 --> 00:06:27.987
You're either Muslim
or an infidel,

00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:29.221
and you'd better be a Muslim.

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:33.760
"Female freedom,
free and fair elections,

00:06:34.427 --> 00:06:37.363
free speech, gay rights."

00:06:38.230 --> 00:06:41.167
I see these
"Queers for Palestine."

00:06:41.234 --> 00:06:42.902
JAMES: Did you hear
their sister organization,

00:06:42.968 --> 00:06:44.070
"Blacks for the KKK"?

00:06:44.136 --> 00:06:47.139
-(BILL LAUGHING)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:06:47.206 --> 00:06:48.340
It's like...

00:06:48.674 --> 00:06:51.310
By the way, I'm a gay man.
I've lived in Berlin.

00:06:51.444 --> 00:06:54.613
This is a level of masochism
that even I cannot comprehend.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.183
-Right. (LAUGHS)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:06:57.249 --> 00:07:00.019
-I mean...
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:07:00.085 --> 00:07:02.087
MATT: You know what?
I'm gonna just--

00:07:02.588 --> 00:07:04.557
Uh, can I just finish my list?

00:07:04.624 --> 00:07:05.857
Uh, "Pedophilia."

00:07:05.991 --> 00:07:07.593
I'll put that under,
"Don't ask."

00:07:09.195 --> 00:07:11.964
Child brides and so forth.
"Equality of the sexes,"

00:07:12.031 --> 00:07:14.801
I'll categorize that under,
"Don't make me fucking laugh."

00:07:15.267 --> 00:07:16.401
Qua-- Uh--

00:07:16.501 --> 00:07:19.105
The fact that, you know,
these people think

00:07:19.238 --> 00:07:23.843
that this is where they should
be aligned with,

00:07:23.976 --> 00:07:25.744
that these are the values
that you support?

00:07:25.811 --> 00:07:29.949
I think this past week has been
a real important moment

00:07:30.082 --> 00:07:31.951
for moral reckoning
on the American Left

00:07:32.451 --> 00:07:34.720
because there is a small,
and I'm gonna emphasize that,

00:07:34.787 --> 00:07:38.490
a very small but growing
and extremely loud faction

00:07:38.557 --> 00:07:40.559
on the American Left
that has revealed itself...

00:07:40.626 --> 00:07:41.960
-BILL: I don't know how small
anymore.
-...to be--

00:07:42.027 --> 00:07:43.095
Okay, well, I don't mean--

00:07:43.162 --> 00:07:45.164
It was all over. It was--

00:07:45.231 --> 00:07:47.766
Well, we just had a conversation
about the algorithm, right?

00:07:48.033 --> 00:07:49.201
And I think you have
a few groups.

00:07:49.301 --> 00:07:51.437
You have some college groups.
You have some activist groups.

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:52.505
BILL: It's college.

00:07:52.638 --> 00:07:54.206
Okay. And again, I--

00:07:54.306 --> 00:07:55.541
You know,
having gone to college,

00:07:55.608 --> 00:07:58.010
I thank God every day
that social media didn't exist,

00:07:58.310 --> 00:07:59.711
-uh, when I was there.
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:07:59.778 --> 00:08:01.780
Um, but I will just say,
you know, my friend--

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.049
my friend, uh, Dan Drezner

00:08:03.115 --> 00:08:04.483
from Tufts University wrote,

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.586
you know, I think recently, um,
he just posted it again.

00:08:07.653 --> 00:08:10.690
He's like, "College is where
you go to say stupid things."

00:08:10.823 --> 00:08:12.291
That is not
to defend what they said.

00:08:12.391 --> 00:08:14.159
I think these things
were gross and reckless.

00:08:14.226 --> 00:08:16.528
And I'll note that a number
of groups that have signed

00:08:16.595 --> 00:08:18.697
some of these statements have
been pulling theirselves off it.

00:08:18.864 --> 00:08:20.599
I don't want
to over-represent this

00:08:20.666 --> 00:08:21.901
as part of the Political Left.

00:08:21.967 --> 00:08:23.902
I absolutely accept
the responsibility,

00:08:23.969 --> 00:08:27.039
as someone who is on the Left
and wants to build a responsible

00:08:27.105 --> 00:08:29.542
and effective Left,
of calling this out.

00:08:29.675 --> 00:08:31.544
Um, but I don't think
we should over-represent

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:33.845
these feelings on the Left
because they are not a majority.

00:08:33.912 --> 00:08:35.180
They are not close
to a majority.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.349
JAMES: I think we need to--

00:08:36.415 --> 00:08:39.084
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)
-BILL: I hope not.

00:08:39.251 --> 00:08:40.819
They're a lot bigger
than they used to be.

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.823
Well, we hear a lot more
about 'em because, as you heard,

00:08:43.956 --> 00:08:46.025
there is an interest
in promoting this.

00:08:46.158 --> 00:08:47.993
I think we need
to shut down Harvard University

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:49.494
until we figure out
what the hell's going on.

00:08:49.594 --> 00:08:54.500
-(LAUGHS)
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:57.203
You're s-- You're saying
they're not sending us--

00:08:57.336 --> 00:08:58.537
they're not sending us
their best?

00:08:58.637 --> 00:09:00.239
They're not sending us
their best, no.

00:09:00.305 --> 00:09:01.907
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-MATT: I do wanna say something

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.375
pretty serious here, though.

00:09:03.509 --> 00:09:06.278
While I will maintain
and agree with James here

00:09:06.512 --> 00:09:07.847
that this is a small minority,

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:10.249 line:0%
um, I have heard
from colleagues,

00:09:10.349 --> 00:09:12.784 line:0%
Jewish colleagues on the Left,
and my friend Michelle Goldberg

00:09:12.851 --> 00:09:14.152 line:0%
wrote a piece
in<i> The New York Times.</i>

00:09:14.219 --> 00:09:16.255 line:0%
My friend Josh Leifer
wrote a piece in<i> Dissent.</i>

00:09:16.689 --> 00:09:18.357 line:0%
And I've been struck
by personal conversations

00:09:18.424 --> 00:09:21.360 line:0%
here too from Jewish colleagues,
on the Left

00:09:21.494 --> 00:09:23.695
who I consider allies,
very close friends,

00:09:23.995 --> 00:09:25.230
and they have been shocked.

00:09:25.431 --> 00:09:27.566
And I take that
very, very seriously.

00:09:27.766 --> 00:09:30.102
Because, again, as someone
who wants to build a serious

00:09:30.169 --> 00:09:31.170
and effective Left,

00:09:31.503 --> 00:09:34.206
if Jews do not feel that
the Left is a home for them,

00:09:34.273 --> 00:09:37.710
we will not have a serious
and effective Left.

